OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering showers becoming
OL,7,Fincreasingly restricted to western
OL,8,Fcoasts this evening, leaving a dry
OL,9,Fnight with variable cloud and some
OL,10,Fclearer spells. A mild night to come
OL,11,Fwith a few mist patches.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FTuesday will start bright for
OL,14,Fmany, some cloud and scattered showers
OL,15,Fspreading in from the west through the
OL,16,Fday. Eastern areas should stay driest,
OL,17,Fwith the best of the brightness.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
