OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBright
OL,6,FWednesday morning before patchy rain
OL,7,Farrives later. Drier and brighter
OL,8,FThursday and Friday, though cloud,
OL,9,Fdrizzle and rain spread east Thursday
OL,10,Fevening. Temperatures staying close to
OL,11,Faverage throughout.
